hy-and-disease-states</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:15:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/unraveling-the-complexity-of-human-brain-structure-function-in-healthy-and-disease-states</guid></item><item><title>如果微小的“原始”黑洞存在，我们可能会通过以下方式找到它们</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/if-tiny-primordial-black-holes-exist-heres-how-we-might-find-them</link><description>现在，麻省理工学院和其他地方的物理学家已经找到了一种天文学家可以探测原始黑洞的方法。研究小组进行了理论计算和三维模拟，以展示如果徘徊的原始黑洞被现代的类日恒星捕获会发生什么。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:00:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/if-tiny-primordial-black-holes-exist-heres-how-we-might-find-them</guid></item><item><title>药物输送颗粒旨在突破血脑屏障</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/drug-delivering-particles-aim-to-breach-the-blood-brain-barrier</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:45:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/drug-delivering-particles-aim-to-breach-the-blood-brain-barrier</guid></item><item><title>研究认为，科学同行评审应分别评估质量和影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/scientific-peer-review-should-rate-quality-and-impact-separately-study-argues</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:30:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/scientific-peer-review-should-rate-quality-and-impact-separately-study-argues</guid></item><item><title>以蛋白质组为中心的图谱将油菜籽的组织特化和植物激素变异联系起来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/a-proteome-centered-atlas-links-tissue-specialization-and-phytohormone-variation-in-rapeseed</link><description>&lt;im